OL,3,GNEWSA'Chanting' away supporters to
OL,4,Amarch through town
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of Austrian football
OL,7,Fsupporters are expected to walk
OL,8,Fen-masse through a seaside town ahead
OL,9,Fof its club's first European home game.
OL,11,FMore than 150 police officers will be
OL,12,Fdeployed when AFC Bournemouth meet
OL,13,FSturm Graz at the Vitality Stadium in
OL,14,Fthe Europa League later.
OL,16,FJust as Cherries fans did in Spain
OL,17,Fahead of their opening away match,
OL,18,Fvisiting supporters are expected to
OL,19,Fmarch towards the stadium in a large
OL,20,Fgroup.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
