OL,3,GNEWSA'Chanting' away supporters to
OL,4,Amarch through town
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Police warned of some traffic
OL,7,Fdisruption but sought to reassure
OL,8,Fresidents, saying the procession was
OL,9,F"absolutely normal" for European
OL,10,Ffootball.
